# Phase 1 - Project Setup

## Project Title
Script-Controlled ACL – Restrict Record Access Based on Field Value

## Platform
ServiceNow

## Objective
To restrict access to Incident records based on the value of
the Priority field.

## Requirement
Critical incidents should be accessible only to administrators.
Other users should not be able to read Critical incidents.

## Table
Incident [incident]

## Field Used
Priority
